  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with singleprofile, pca_n2000 RNA encoder, and resnet50 image encoder achieve moderate accuracy (0.5266). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with a more powerful imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping other settings the same (singleprofile, pca_n2000, aggregation=None, fusion=concat). This clarifies whether the image encoder's architecture significantly impacts performance, a critical design choice with high uncertainty. It balances exploitation (building on the current multimodal/singleprofile baseline) and exploration (testing a stronger image encoder)."
}

